    ],
    [
     "TANOBY KEY",
     "SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_TanobyKey",
     "one small room (LONG DROP's)"
    ]
   ],
   "look": "THE LINE. A long burrow of warm packed earth under the routes, and along the top of every cut runs the buried cable it was dug to reach: a red sheath over a dark core, two pixels deep, following the cut wherever it turns. The faces are packed clods; the ground above is calm earth with soft rises; TAPPOINT's holes are kept. Light: umber and ochre; the cable is the one colour that is not earth.",
   "split": "No split: TANOBY KEY is one room and an earth room suits it."
  },
  {
